the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    the calculation date is *a date*; scenario element.
    the household of *a person* meets social security act benefit criterion.
    the household of *a person* meets qualifying general assistance benefit criterion.
    the household of *a person* has snap participation basis from income or categorical benefits.
    the each household member of *a person* receives benefits under state program funded under part_a title iv social security act; scenario element.
    the each household member of *a person* receives supplemental security income benefits under title xvi social security act; scenario element.
    the each household member of *a person* receives aid to aged blind or disabled under title i x xiv or xvi social security act; scenario element.
    the each household member of *a person* receives benefits under state or local general assistance program; scenario element.
    the state or local general assistance program of *a person* uses income criteria comparable to or more restrictive than subsection c 2; scenario element.
    the state or local general assistance program of *a person* is not limited to one time emergency payments unavailable for more than one consecutive month; scenario element.
    the household income and other financial resources of *a person* are substantial limiting factor in permitting more nutritious diet; scenario element.

the knowledge base us_statutes_7_2014_a includes:


% 7 U.S.C. 2014(a) — us:statutes/7/2014/a
the text of "7 U.S.C. 2014(a)" is at "sources/us/statutes/7/2014/a.yaml".

rule household_meets_social_security_act_benefit_criterion_1 with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2014(a)":
the household of a person meets social security act benefit criterion if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D
    and the each household member of the person receives benefits under state program funded under part_a title iv social security act.

rule household_meets_social_security_act_benefit_criterion_2 with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2014(a)":
the household of a person meets social security act benefit criterion if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D
    and the each household member of the person receives supplemental security income benefits under title xvi social security act.

rule household_meets_social_security_act_benefit_criterion_3 with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2014(a)":
the household of a person meets social security act benefit criterion if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D
    and the each household member of the person receives aid to aged blind or disabled under title i x xiv or xvi social security act.

rule household_meets_qualifying_general_assistance_benefit_criterion with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2014(a)":
the household of a person meets qualifying general assistance benefit criterion if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D
    and the each household member of the person receives benefits under state or local general assistance program
    and the state or local general assistance program of the person uses income criteria comparable to or more restrictive than subsection c 2
    and the state or local general assistance program of the person is not limited to one time emergency payments unavailable for more than one consecutive month.

rule household_has_snap_participation_basis_from_income_or_categorical_benefits_1 with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2014(a)":
the household of a person has snap participation basis from income or categorical benefits if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D
    and the household income and other financial resources of the person are substantial limiting factor in permitting more nutritious diet.

rule household_has_snap_participation_basis_from_income_or_categorical_benefits_2 with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2014(a)":
the household of a person has snap participation basis from income or categorical benefits if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D
    and the household of the person meets social security act benefit criterion.

rule household_has_snap_participation_basis_from_income_or_categorical_benefits_3 with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2014(a)":
the household of a person has snap participation basis from income or categorical benefits if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D
    and the household of the person meets qualifying general assistance benefit criterion.

scenario no_income_or_categorical_basis is, as stated in "sources/us/statutes/7/2014/a.test.yaml" at case 1:
