    the each household member of person_1 receives supplemental security income benefits under title xvi social security act.
    q_household_has_snap_participation_basis_from_income_or_categorical_benefits expects answers ["the household of person_1 has snap participation basis from income or categorical benefits"].
    q_household_meets_qualifying_general_assistance_benefit_criterion expects answers [].
    q_household_meets_social_security_act_benefit_criterion expects answers ["the household of person_1 meets social security act benefit criterion"].

scenario qualifying_general_assistance_categorical_basis is, as stated in "sources/us/statutes/7/2014/a.test.yaml" at case 4:
    person_1 is a person.
    the calculation date is 2008-10-01.
    the each household member of person_1 receives benefits under state or local general assistance program.
    the state or local general assistance program of person_1 is not limited to one time emergency payments unavailable for more than one consecutive month.
    the state or local general assistance program of person_1 uses income criteria comparable to or more restrictive than subsection c 2.
    q_household_has_snap_participation_basis_from_income_or_categorical_benefits expects answers ["the household of person_1 has snap participation basis from income or categorical benefits"].
    q_household_meets_qualifying_general_assistance_benefit_criterion expects answers ["the household of person_1 meets qualifying general assistance benefit criterion"].
    q_household_meets_social_security_act_benefit_criterion expects answers [].

